RUF061 [*] Use context-manager form of `pytest.warns()`
  --> RUF061_warns.py:21:5
   |
20 | def test_error_trivial():
21 |     pytest.warns(UserWarning, raise_user_warning, "warning")
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: Use `pytest.warns()` as a context-manager
   |
20 | def test_error_trivial():
   -     pytest.warns(UserWarning, raise_user_warning, "warning")
21 +     with pytest.warns(UserWarning):
22 +         raise_user_warning("warning")
23 |
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

